325, "timestamp": "00:16:33", "text": "確實會是典範。 呃，驚艷，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 994.768, "timestamp": "00:16:34", "text": "呃，驚艷， 我當時想，“好吧，呃——”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 996.211, "timestamp": "00:16:36", "text": "我當時想，“好吧，呃——” 安裝完成後，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 997.581, "timestamp": "00:16:37", "text": "安裝完成後，我 我會命令這個人，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 999.061, "timestamp": "00:16:39", "text": "我會命令這個人， 我與他勢均力敵。 」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1003.976, "timestamp": "00:16:43", "text": "我與他勢均力敵。 」 它與…類似"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1004.802, "timestamp": "00:16:44", "text": "它與…類似 完美首秀，正如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1005.992, "timestamp": "00:16:45", "text": "完美首秀，正如 經過深思熟慮，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1007.281, "timestamp": "00:16:47", "text": "經過深思熟慮， 設計精良，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1013.468, "timestamp": "00:16:53", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Look at this fairy"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1016.792, "timestamp": "00:16:56", "text": "高品質的出道作品"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1018.096, "timestamp": "00:16:58", "text": "這正是我想要的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1019.399, "timestamp": "00:16:59", "text": "但情況就是這樣。"}]